OG-AmpJack is a port of AmpJack (https://github.com/Roasted-Codes/AmpJack), itself a fork of
Jacckii/Xbox360-Series-Controllers-Native, licensed under the GNU GPL version 3 or later (LICENSE).

Protocol and adapter definitions in src/core derive from xone (https://github.com/dlundqvist/xone)
and mt76 (https://github.com/openwrt/mt76); those files keep their original copyright headers.
